  "statement": "The smaller root of the equation\n\n\\[ \\begin{aligned} &\\left(x-\\frac34\\right)\\left(x-\\frac34\\right)\\\\ &\\quad+\\left(x-\\frac34\\right) \\left(x-\\frac12\\right)=0 \\end{aligned} \\]\n\nis:",
